    "notes": "Tamboran is an exploration-stage natural gas company focused on the Beetaloo Basin in Australia's Northern Territory. FY ends June 30. Holds interests through 50/50 JV (TB1) with Daly Waters Energy LP. Acquired 77.5% share of Beetaloo Basin assets (EP 76, EP 98, EP 117) in Nov 2022. 40 MMcf/d Shenandoah South Pilot Central Facility under construction. ORRI of 2.34358% granted to Daly Waters Royalty. No production, no proved reserves, no hedging. Uses successful efforts accounting under ASC 932."
